{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_071D60","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你说过你父亲参加过曼哈顿计划，对吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"你觉得自己不能走路，是受那件事影响？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"……不好说。不，恐怕不是吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"到目前为止，还没有发现证据表明父母受到辐射照射会对子女产生遗传影响。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"当然，胎内受照射的情况另当别论……从流行病学上来说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"这是<R=原爆伤害调查委员会,ABCC>的数据？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=原爆伤害调查委员会,ABCC>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"嗯。<R=原爆伤害调查委员会,ABCC>在战后不久就开始调查被爆者，而且直到现在还在继续。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=原爆伤害调查委员会,ABCC>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"都已经过去30年了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":32,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"辐射的影响会持续很久。就连遗传影响的调查，要得出一个初步结论，恐怕还得再等10年。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":119,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"确实，这是前所未有的大规模调查。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"但真的只是调查。<R=原爆伤害调查委员会,ABCC>把被爆者叫来检查，却不给他们治疗。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=原爆伤害调查委员会,ABCC>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"这样啊……他们也是……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"不管怎么说，我从小就被父亲灌输这种想法……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"也许那只是你父亲苦于解释，最后想出的说法吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"也许吧。不过，Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":29,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"这已经是我自己的问题了。不管喜欢与否，我都只能继续正面面对“核武器”这种存在。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"而我的成果正要被用在错误的方向上。我无论如何都想阻止。帮我吧，Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":""}]}